-- at exactly 30 questions (the original seeding floor). Adds 24 further questions on topics NOT
-- already covered by mcq_part5_project_control_manager_seed.sql (verified by diffing topic
-- lists): SV/CV variance calculation, TCPI calculation, change control board, cost breakdown
-- structure, contingency drawdown, integrated master schedule, escalation/indexation.
-- Domain grounding: PMBOK Earned Value Management formulas (SV, CV, TCPI), change-control
-- governance, cost engineering practice (AACE).
-- Same rotation technique as supabase/seed/mcq_questions_seed.sql. Idempotent via
-- (job_role, md5(stem_fa)) unique index.

